WEBVTT

00:00:08.883 --> 00:00:10.043
(CREAKING)

00:00:11.323 --> 00:00:12.363
(LOUD THUDDING)

00:00:12.523 --> 00:00:13.803
(WIND HOWLING)

00:00:19.403 --> 00:00:21.163
(MOUTHING)

00:00:21.563 --> 00:00:22.563
(SLAMS)

00:00:24.563 --> 00:00:25.723
(EERIE MUSIC PLAYING)

00:00:26.683 --> 00:00:27.723
Mama!

00:00:28.243 --> 00:00:29.403
Mama!

00:00:29.803 --> 00:00:31.883
(DISTORTING) Mama...

00:00:33.883 --> 00:00:34.843
(RANGERS GASP)

00:00:35.243 --> 00:00:37.003
-(SCRATCHING)
-(GASPING)

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:38.203
(CREAKING)

00:00:40.563 --> 00:00:41.563
(LOUD SCRATCH)

00:00:43.363 --> 00:00:44.403
(LOUD SCRATCH)

00:00:46.363 --> 00:00:47.403
What the...

00:00:47.563 --> 00:00:48.523
(RANGERS GASPING)

00:00:49.203 --> 00:00:50.683
(FOREST RANGERS MURMURING)

00:00:50.763 --> 00:00:52.363
-Now what?
-Phase two.

00:00:52.923 --> 00:00:54.803
-(CLATTERING)
-(RANGERS GASPING)

00:00:55.843 --> 00:00:57.323
-(RANGER WHIMPERS)
-Keep together.

00:00:59.003 --> 00:01:01.083
(RANGERS SCREAMING)

00:01:04.123 --> 00:01:05.483
(RANGERS MURMURING)

00:01:07.083 --> 00:01:08.283
(WHISPERING) Are you ready?

00:01:08.443 --> 00:01:10.203
-Mike, I can't.
-Yes, you can.

00:01:10.283 --> 00:01:12.283
Stop being a Sullivan
and start being you.

00:01:13.123 --> 00:01:14.163
MALE RANGER: Call for backup.

00:01:14.323 --> 00:01:15.603
FOREST RANGER:
Assistance on the north side.

00:01:15.883 --> 00:01:18.123
Repeat, we need assistance
on the north side.

00:01:18.283 --> 00:01:20.003
DISPATCH ON RADIO: Ranger,
answer me, what's your 20?

00:01:20.083 --> 00:01:22.603
We need assistance on the north side.
We have a...

00:01:22.803 --> 00:01:23.963
-(ALL GASPING)
-Look! What was it?

00:01:24.043 --> 00:01:25.283
Let's go.

00:01:25.963 --> 00:01:28.283
(RANGERS CHATTERING
INDISTINCTLY)

00:01:33.923 --> 00:01:34.963
(RANGERS GASPING)

00:01:36.563 --> 00:01:37.603
(ALL GRUNTING)

00:01:39.243 --> 00:01:40.283
(ROARING)

00:01:40.483 --> 00:01:41.763
(ALL SCREAMING)

00:01:42.203 --> 00:01:43.843
(SCREAMS ECHOING)

00:01:45.603 --> 00:01:47.163
(CANISTERS DINGING)

00:01:53.163 --> 00:01:54.243
-(ROARING)
-(RANGERS WHIMPERING)

00:01:54.323 --> 00:01:55.523
(RANGERS SCREAMING)

00:02:01.643 --> 00:02:02.643
Sulley, come on!

00:02:05.163 --> 00:02:06.163
(GASPS)

00:02:07.243 --> 00:02:08.403
(BOTH GRUNT)

00:02:14.843 --> 00:02:16.363
(BOTH PANTING)

00:02:28.963 --> 00:02:30.123
HARDSCRABBLE: How?

00:02:31.523 --> 00:02:33.003
(STAMMERS) How did you do this?

00:02:34.203 --> 00:02:35.363
Don't ask me.

00:02:39.203 --> 00:02:40.403
-(SPARKS CRACKLING)
-(GASPS)

00:02:43.483 --> 00:02:45.363
Move, move, move!
This is a 54-23 in progress.

00:02:45.483 --> 00:02:46.603
All right, everybody, clear out.

00:02:47.003 --> 00:02:48.443
Secure the perimeter.

00:02:48.523 --> 00:02:50.603
No child breach.
Repeat: no child breach.

00:02:51.123 --> 00:02:52.363
You ruined our doors!

00:02:52.443 --> 00:02:54.763
I've been working on my door
all semester!

00:02:54.843 --> 00:02:55.843
Let's go, you two.

00:02:56.083 --> 00:02:58.243
-You're alive!
-We are so glad you're safe.

00:03:02.083 --> 00:03:03.083
Hey, wait!

00:03:03.163 --> 00:03:04.123
What's going to happen to them?

00:03:04.203 --> 00:03:07.363
CDA AGENT: That's for the university
president to decide.

00:03:08.043 --> 00:03:11.963
But you can be sure
we'll be watching these two.

00:03:12.043 --> 00:03:14.043
Always watching.

00:03:19.203 --> 00:03:21.443
-Expelled?
-Yeah, we really messed up.

00:03:22.403 --> 00:03:24.123
So, you're leaving?

00:03:24.483 --> 00:03:26.763
Yeah, buddy. We have to go.

00:03:27.643 --> 00:03:29.083
Harsh, man.

00:03:29.363 --> 00:03:31.843
I'm sorry, guys.
You'd be in the Scaring program

00:03:31.923 --> 00:03:33.003
right now if it wasn't for us.

00:03:36.163 --> 00:03:37.163
What?

00:03:37.483 --> 00:03:39.683
Well, (CHUCKLES) it is
the gosh-darnedest thing.

00:03:39.763 --> 00:03:41.803
Hardscrabble's letting us
into the Scare program.

00:03:41.883 --> 00:03:42.963
What?

00:03:43.043 --> 00:03:45.163
She was impressed with
our performance in the games.

00:03:45.243 --> 00:03:47.243
She invited us to join next semester!

00:03:47.483 --> 00:03:49.843
(CHUCKLES) Congratulations, guys!

00:03:50.123 --> 00:03:52.323
And that's not the only piece
of good news.

00:03:52.403 --> 00:03:54.123
Sherrie and I are engaged!

00:03:54.483 --> 00:03:56.603
Oh. Who is Sherrie?

00:03:57.243 --> 00:03:58.723
(SIGHING) She's my mom.

00:03:58.803 --> 00:04:01.723
Well, if it isn't my two favorite fellas!

00:04:01.803 --> 00:04:03.363
Come here. Give me some sugar.

00:04:03.443 --> 00:04:04.483
-Oh!
-(BOTH CHUCKLING)

00:04:05.123 --> 00:04:06.843
Ugh! So uncomfortable.

00:04:06.923 --> 00:04:08.323
Oh, come on, Scott.

00:04:08.403 --> 00:04:10.443
I don't want you to think of me
as your new dad.

00:04:10.523 --> 00:04:12.683
After all, we're fraternity brothers first.

00:04:12.763 --> 00:04:13.803
This is so weird.

00:04:14.123 --> 00:04:15.643
DON: Just think of me
as your big brother

00:04:15.923 --> 00:04:17.203
that's marrying your mother.

00:04:17.283 --> 00:04:18.363
Wait. Hold on.

00:04:18.443 --> 00:04:21.683
We're brothers who share
the same mom slash wife.

00:04:21.763 --> 00:04:22.763
That's worse.

00:04:24.723 --> 00:04:26.403
Well, I guess we should be going now.

00:04:28.163 --> 00:04:30.443
Promise me you'll keep in touch.

00:04:35.763 --> 00:04:38.763
You're the scariest bunch
of monsters I have ever met.

00:04:41.803 --> 00:04:44.123
Don't let anyone tell you different.

00:04:57.883 --> 00:04:59.483
(ALL CHUCKLING)

00:05:10.163 --> 00:05:13.163
So, what now?

00:05:14.243 --> 00:05:17.243
You know, for the first time in my life,
I don't really have a plan.

00:05:17.923 --> 00:05:21.643
You're the great Mike Wazowski.
You'll come up with something.

00:05:22.603 --> 00:05:25.483
I think it's time I leave the greatness
to other monsters.

00:05:26.443 --> 00:05:29.243
I'm okay just being okay.

00:05:37.683 --> 00:05:38.803
So long, Sull.

00:05:40.243 --> 00:05:41.283
So long.

